{"id":"631bf0c6e7aae72d3a048a6376d88e849b0f67fe","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1238867","title":"GPT sol 的上下文长度设置成多少比较合适，默认的 200k 太短了，随便几下就开始合并了， 1m 到后面又有点顾头不顾尾的","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"coder121","excerpt":"程序员 - @coder121 -","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18041834\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1cbc/df6c/609080_normal.png?m=1768017493\" alt=\"QS0x01\" data-uid=\"609080\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/QS0x01\">QS0x01</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-02 11:13:53 +08:00\">23h 18m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我参考的官方 API 双倍价格门槛 272K 那个界限，略微留一点缓冲区，取个整 300K 让它开始压缩。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18041852\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1744/6a8a/10573_normal.png?m=1788153818\" alt=\"schemesAlot\" data-uid=\"10573\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/schemesAlot\">schemesAlot</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-02 11:17:10 +08:00\">23h 14m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>试过 tibo 说的那个 1m,用了两次就删了,坚持 272,官压除了慢没毛病</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18041872\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/096e4a7dd94423358c6d4aa94a8bd70f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Rickkkkkkk\" data-uid=\"287234\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Rickkkkkkk\">Rickkkkkkk</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-02 11:19:37 +08:00\">23h 12m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>codex 默认的肯定就是最合适的，1m 真的好用，那默认的设置为什么不是 1m</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18042516\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/721ac1354ab27a00d16947f5b8fc4e47?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"zed1018\" data-uid=\"315288\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zed1018\">zed1018</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-02 14:06:35 +08:00\">20h 25m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>别说 codex 了，CC 早就开放 1M ，且默认 1M 。但是实际上/usage 里都会提示 &gt;150K 的应该 compact ，因为计费很贵。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18043209\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5e37/b76a/119748_normal.png?m=1710228712\" alt=\"yh7gdiaYW\" data-uid=\"119748\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yh7gdiaYW\">yh7gdiaYW</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-02 16:02:05 +08:00\">18h 29m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Rickkkkkkk\">Rickkkkkkk</a> 因为 openai 搞阶梯计费导致开 1m 很贵。codex 刚开始默认也不是 272k ，不会自己管控上下文的初级用户太多导致用量消耗太快，意见太大了才缩回去的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18044265\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/115a490987cf7ddc76b2472e52b3b9fb?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"tagee\" data-uid=\"469864\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/tagee\">tagee</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-02 21:22:49 +08:00\">13h 9m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我设置过 1m 的，体验很好啊，很久都不会看到他在压缩上下文。但是额度扛不住，感觉跟开了 fast 似的，额度蹭蹭往下掉。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18044375\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a4249e407b17a518d467a1e17cf22cfd?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"zuosiruan\" data-uid=\"204104\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zuosiruan\">zuosiruan</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-02 22:51:51 +08:00\">11h 40m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我用的 500KB</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18044529\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6ed4ee4dd2e384a9d8d47d2e7f43c5c4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"maolon\" data-uid=\"442547\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/maolon\">maolon</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 03:23:08 +08:00\">7h 8m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>按 matt （ grill me 作者）的说法应该 150k 就 compact ，5.6 默认是 272k ，分段计费开始于 272 ，所以 272 之上会消耗会很大至少 sol 和 terra 不推荐开高，luna 对于长任务可以适当拉满使用</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18044649\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1e61/36d9/328834_normal.png?m=1654752690\" alt=\"IMengXin\" data-uid=\"328834\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/IMengXin\">IMengXin</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-03 08:33:59 +08:00\">1h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>为啥我没调整过，自己变 1M 了。。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div></DIV>","content_text":"1 QS0x01 23h 18m ago 我参考的官方 API 双倍价格门槛 272K 那个界限，略微留一点缓冲区，取个整 300K 让它开始压缩。 2 schemesAlot 23h 14m ago 试过 tibo 说的那个 1m,用了两次就删了,坚持 272,官压除了慢没毛病 3 Rickkkkkkk 23h 12m ago codex 默认的肯定就是最合适的，1m 真的好用，那默认的设置为什么不是 1m 6 zed1018 20h 25m ago 别说 codex 了，CC 早就开放 1M ，且默认 1M 。但是实际上/usage 里都会提示 >150K 的应该 compact ，因为计费很贵。 7 yh7gdiaYW 18h 29m ago @Rickkkkkkk 因为 openai 搞阶梯计费导致开 1m 很贵。codex 刚开始默认也不是 272k ，不会自己管控上下文的初级用户太多导致用量消耗太快，意见太大了才缩回去的 12 tagee 13h 9m ago 我设置过 1m 的，体验很好啊，很久都不会看到他在压缩上下文。但是额度扛不住，感觉跟开了 fast 似的，额度蹭蹭往下掉。 13 zuosiruan 11h 40m ago via iPhone 我用的 500KB 14 maolon 7h 8m ago 按 matt （ grill me 作者）的说法应该 150k 就 compact ，5.6 默认是 272k ，分段计费开始于 272 ，所以 272 之上会消耗会很大至少 sol 和 terra 不推荐开高，luna 对于长任务可以适当拉满使用 15 IMengXin 1h 58m ago 为啥我没调整过，自己变 1M 了。。","fetched_at":"2026-09-03T02:35:26.962Z","ok":true}